{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOU! Yes, YOU! How\u2019d you like to become a video game tester?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help a developer test out several game prototypes he's thrown together in his quest to discover the ultimate formula for creating the perfect video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> He\u2019ll guide you, watch your every move, and provide insightful comments throughout your journey and tests. <i>(Insightful? Really?)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>These levels will put to the test</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your willpower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your deduction skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your calm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your perseverance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your patience twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your improvisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While his work borders on perfection (<i>it doesn\u2019t</i>), you might very occasionally run into some minor bugs. (<i>He once took down the power in the entire building after a patch.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll explore a wide variety of game genres, puzzles, shooters, collectathons, renovation sims, horror, suspense, walking simulators, RPGs\u2026 and more.<br>All these levels are based on 100% original ideas, carefully crafted specifically for his<i> </i>work. (<i>Not true at all.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one\u2019s expecting perfection from you, mistakes are human, and we\u2019re all human! (<i>What are you even talking about?</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you soon! I can\u2019t wait to see how you\u2019ll handle it all and help me reach my goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> (<i>...And he forgot to write this in the third person.</i>)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3899420?t=1753863189","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/40b744fb2e505b4e703c35c5f8104d7b0b911209/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753863189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/73dde5d11e2f3ef15f6017522899683653757f09/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753863189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/73dde5d11e2f3ef15f6017522899683653757f09/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753863189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>YOU! Yes, YOU! How\u2019d you like to become a video game tester?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Help a developer test out several game prototypes he's thrown together in his quest to discover the ultimate formula for creating the perfect video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> He\u2019ll guide you, watch your every move, and provide insightful comments throughout your journey and tests. <i>(Insightful? Really?)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>These levels will put to the test</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your willpower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your deduction skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your calm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your perseverance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your patience twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your improvisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While his work borders on perfection (<i>it doesn\u2019t</i>), you might very occasionally run into some minor bugs. (<i>He once took down the power in the entire building after a patch.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll explore a wide variety of game genres, puzzles, shooters, collectathons, renovation sims, horror, suspense, walking simulators, RPGs\u2026 and more.<br>All these levels are based on 100% original ideas, carefully crafted specifically for his<i> </i>work. (<i>Not true at all.</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No one\u2019s expecting perfection from you, mistakes are human, and we\u2019re all human! (<i>What are you even talking about?</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">See you soon! I can\u2019t wait to see how you\u2019ll handle it all and help me reach my goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> (<i>...And he forgot to write this in the third person.</i>)</p>","developers":["Mr_Bloodjack"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/78abb8f5de58291464c3f5ae18fbd249696dfc7e/header.jpg?t=1753863189","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257172897,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akama